---
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="chip">// the.problem</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Agents do the work. You do the last mile.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Molt Code is built around one idea: give agents the access they need to actually do things, and let humans focus on review and course-correction. They build, you check — from wherever you are.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pane">
    <div class="pane-header">
      <div class="pane-dots">
        <span class="pane-dot"></span>
        <span class="pane-dot"></span>
        <span class="pane-dot"></span>
      </div>
      <span class="pane-path">~/access/who-needs-what.diff</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pane-body">
      <div class="diff-grid">
        <!-- AGENTS NEED -->
        <div class="diff-col">
          <div class="diff-head diff-head--after">
            <span class="diff-marker">+</span> agents need access
          </div>
          <ul class="diff-list">
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">01</span><span class="diff-title">Real machines, real environments</span><span class="diff-desc">Not a sandbox. Full filesystem, real shells, real toolchains — the same env you'd run yourself.</span></li>
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">02</span><span class="diff-title">Long-running processes</span><span class="diff-desc">Dev servers, builds, tests. Persistent across sessions. Agents read the logs as they happen.</span></li>
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">03</span><span class="diff-title">Always-on connectivity</span><span class="diff-desc">A reliable pipe to your repo, your APIs, your services — even when your laptop is asleep.</span></li>
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">04</span><span class="diff-title">Persistent context</span><span class="diff-desc">PRDs, issues, docs travel with every session. They always know the goal.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- HUMANS NEED -->
        <div class="diff-col">
          <div class="diff-head diff-head--after">
            <span class="diff-marker">+</span> you need to see it
          </div>
          <ul class="diff-list">
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">01</span><span class="diff-title">Review the diffs from anywhere</span><span class="diff-desc">Phone on the couch. iPad at the cafe. Approve, redirect, or reject — without sitting at the desk.</span></li>
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">02</span><span class="diff-title">See what they built</span><span class="diff-desc">Port-forwarding built in. The dev server an agent just started? Open it on your phone and click around.</span></li>
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">03</span><span class="diff-title">Leave the heavy machine at home</span><span class="diff-desc">Buy one good desktop. Carry a light Mac. The desktop runs the agents — you connect from whatever you've got.</span></li>
            <li><span class="diff-num diff-num--accent">04</span><span class="diff-title">Same workspace, every location</span><span class="diff-desc">Hawaii, Bali, or your kitchen. You access the same project, the same agents, the same diffs.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .diff-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .diff-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .diff-col + .diff-col {
      padding-left: 2rem;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .diff-col:first-child {
      padding-right: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .diff-head {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .diff-marker {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 0.375rem;
  }

  .diff-head--before .diff-marker { color: #C75C5C; }
  .diff-head--after .diff-marker { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .diff-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .diff-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 0.25rem 0.875rem;
  }

  .diff-num {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    grid-row: span 2;
    padding-top: 0.125rem;
  }

  .diff-num--accent {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .diff-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .diff-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
